sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 客户端
    participant Gateway as API网关
    participant RiskControl as 风控服务
    participant Dispatch as 调度服务
    participant Validate as 验证服务
    participant Withdraw as 提款服务
    participant RiskMgmt as 风控管理
    participant Matchup as 撮合服务
    participant Redis as Redis缓存
    participant DB as 数据库
    participant MQ as 消息队列
    participant ThirdParty as 三方渠道

    Client->>Gateway: POST /withdraw/create
    Gateway->>RiskControl: 风控验证
    RiskControl-->>Gateway: 验证结果

    alt 风控通过
        Gateway->>Dispatch: 路由请求
        Dispatch->>RiskMgmt: 重复订单检查
        RiskMgmt->>Redis: 检查订单重复
        Redis-->>RiskMgmt: 检查结果
        RiskMgmt-->>Dispatch: 检查通过

        Dispatch->>Validate: 参数验证
        Validate->>DB: 查询商户信息
        DB-->>Validate: 商户数据
        Validate-->>Dispatch: 验证结果

        alt 验证通过
            Dispatch->>Withdraw: 创建提款订单
            Withdraw->>DB: 保存订单
            DB-->>Withdraw: 订单ID
            Withdraw->>MQ: 发送订单消息
            Withdraw->>Matchup: 调用撮合服务
            Matchup->>Redis: 查询可用充值订单
            Redis-->>Matchup: 充值订单列表
            Matchup->>DB: 保存撮合结果
            DB-->>Matchup: 保存成功
            Matchup->>Redis: 设置过期时间
            Matchup-->>Withdraw: 撮合结果
            Withdraw-->>Dispatch: 订单创建结果
            Dispatch-->>Gateway: 响应结果
            Gateway-->>Client: 返回响应
        else 验证失败
            Validate-->>Dispatch: 验证错误
            Dispatch-->>Gateway: 错误响应
            Gateway-->>Client: 返回错误
        end
    else 风控拒绝
        RiskControl-->>Gateway: 风控拒绝
        Gateway-->>Client: 返回拒绝
    end